[{"type":"message","user":"U0217DB46P7","text":"\u003c@U0217DB46P7\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1620455769.227400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"90A188DF-9698-4CEC-AC15-AC3D88FD03E9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"オンデマンドプリントは流行して欲しい","ts":"1620448613.227100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=1ww"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84f9cc06-3299-4801-842e-c795941dc0af","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"絶版というか増版はしない(市場の紙書籍の在庫増えない)はいいので、カタログの充実とオンデマンド注文を確実に受けてくれるとかは欲しいよなあ","ts":"1620446991.226100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RLuQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c8f1d98-0f3d-44a2-833b-497db3f319fa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ、ただたしかに専門書だと値段とかの微妙なところでコストアップするとギリギリだったのが辛くなるのはあるか。","ts":"1620446912.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Syi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4184ba07-fd6a-4bcf-9762-18721df17be8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"一般的な書籍と比べて需要が桁違いに少ない本を刷り続けるのは大変なんでしょうねー。だからこそ印刷費用のかからない PDF 化が進んでほしい。","ts":"1620446807.224100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jFgC7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a12e62d1-6843-466e-8b28-80d6e3ccfedf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれ、大分前から変えるからねと言われてた(+猶予をとってた)ので、またちょっと違う問題もある気がするなあ...","ts":"1620446447.223300","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1620446457.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oi//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D09A1A9F-9251-4271-B983-1356F094C290","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"消費税の表記が変わって絶版が増えるという話がありますね","ts":"1620445810.222300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x2QRV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36c1bc59-a142-4c91-be8e-3289ddb12744","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"大学の図書館や研究室の本棚は本当にありがたい存在でしたねー。あと古本屋。\nプログラミング関係の本は電子書籍も割と充実してるけど理学書はそうでもない気がするので、理学書はまだ物理で買うことも多いかな、という感じです。\nPDF が売られてたらそっちを買いますけどね。","ts":"1620445316.221000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kwx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a9d0a58-1250-422e-bcef-889b1aa713c0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"はよDRMフリー電子書籍が主流になってほしい","ts":"1620444902.218200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7WMR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e098a09-2c95-4967-ac27-eaa3fe918aaf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"絶版になった専門書はJSTAGEに入れといてほしい","ts":"1620444804.217800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tiH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6192696-9768-477b-8bd0-89b14ed4788d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"電子書籍、絶版どころかそもそもストアが潰れたらアウトだしなぁ","ts":"1620444736.217700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0x2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd32f116-f1e9-4936-bb63-9e4042d2bf2f","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"知のアーカイブとして絶版はなくして欲しい・・・少なくとも電子書籍では","ts":"1620442555.217200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KZH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edd557c9-79ec-4196-a898-2c6b43b3bd04","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分が電子書籍派なの、絶版とかあるのもあるな","ts":"1620442138.216100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5gXj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e6daee5-6d66-44da-a5bd-36beed823bd6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"理学書は絶版になりやすく、欲しい本が中古で1万とか2万とかになることがザラにあるのがつらい","ts":"1620442057.215700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K6SDK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a11deac8-0d27-4975-94f6-9862ea9478a3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"本屋で物色しているときは一瞬でも引っかかるものがあったら買う。","ts":"1620436491.215400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vdxO/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ea50a70-e9f0-46de-a20e-7edff605f91a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"本くらいだと30秒かな","ts":"1620436464.215000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ttFgg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8294e2cd-f8cf-4e29-9496-aeab7a3b7560","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"心の中か声で3回「ほしい」と言ったら買え、くらい?","ts":"1620435808.214500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KwD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"443eb311-6d42-4c1a-924a-77c0694641f0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もっと短いな…","ts":"1620435722.214000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6WOy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccae5e06-2657-4bb5-8b3c-749d339b107a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/subarusatosi/status/1390695413066321923?s=19|https://twitter.com/subarusatosi/status/1390695413066321923?s=19\u003e","ts":"1620431335.213500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/subarusatosi|@subarusatosi\u003e: 本は3回買おうか迷ったら買えという話がある","id":1,"author_name":"とある高専卒業生","author_subname":"@subarusatosi","author_link":"https://twitter.com/subarusatosi/status/1390695413066321923","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358908799759753219/b43QFYYi_normal.jpg","text":"本は3回買おうか迷ったら買えとい